Package: com.chatgpt.globaltimepitchfix
Name: GlobalTimePitchFix - Bili VLC ScaleTempo Smooth Switch
Version: 0.7.3
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Experimental Bilibili iOS 13 playback-speed audio using VLC-style scaletempo on a worker thread. The ijk source callback remains on the AudioQueue thread; DSP is decoupled through SPSC PCM rings; 0.7.3 adds bridge/drain transitions for smoother 1x <-> speed changes. 1x is exact PCM bypass.
Maintainer: ChatGPT + user test build
Author: ChatGPT + user test build
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 13.0), mobilesubstrate | org.coolstar.libhooker
